<title>SOUTH AFRICA: AGA to change name to Capital Alliance.</title>
<headline>AGA to change name to Capital Alliance.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>AGA Holdings Ltd said on Monday that its name would change to Capital Alliance Holdings Ltd to more accurately reflect the changed nature of the shareholding structure of the new group.</p>
<p>The AGA group now incorporates the acquisitions of Capital Alliance and NDH Bank Ltd and operates as a fully fledged financial services group.</p>
<p>The change of name will be effective from Nov 18.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
